{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.poster.avif?t=1768638294\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.webm?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.mp4?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cScreaming In The Basement\u201d\u00a0</i></strong>is a first-person psychological horror game, delving into an evil rooted beyond<strong> </strong>darkness, a realistic and immersive horror atmosphere. an investigative reporter called Mike investigates a tragic family murder. Strange things from 1991 occur. This game is inspired by P.T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>\u201cIn Early Access! Your feedback helps make the game better.\u201d</u></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/10cf9296676b88d2be3719a84e0a22f9.poster.avif?t=1768638294\" aria-label=\"Apart\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/10cf9296676b88d2be3719a84e0a22f9.webm?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/10cf9296676b88d2be3719a84e0a22f9.mp4?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR STORY BEGINS, THEIR FATE UNFOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike is the main character, a journalist always chasing the story behind the story. He gains access to an apartment that, according to news reports, is said to be home to restless souls, though no one has ever confirmed it. The residence is tied to a terrible incident. A family once lived in the apartment and was killed by someone whose identity remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.poster.avif?t=1768638294\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.webm?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.mp4?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTENSE, IMMERSIVE JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong><br>&quot;Walking Simulator&quot; focused on story, exploration, and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Three different endings unfold depending on the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong><br>Aesthetic inspired by the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lens of Reality</strong><br>You\u2019ll carry a powerful Polaroid camera that exposes the things no human eye can see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong><br>The immersive sound design pulls you deeper into the experience, building tension at every moment until you\u2019re fully surrounded by a growing sense of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Paranormal activity makes objects move and causes the environment to change in strange and unexpected ways, making you feel something beyond this world is present.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.poster.avif?t=1768638294\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.webm?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.mp4?t=1768638294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRIPPING CINEMATIC EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness creeps in every corner, and silence hides the screams. The intense psychological horror into madness, the game draws you into a cinematic nightmare where every moment feels like a scene from your worst horror film, and the truth you\u2019re searching for may be the very thing that destroys you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/df97ebe17628b235a9410485c953b26fd5da2c5e.jpg"},{"name":"Into The Sand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/0d24c5be43e78558f451f5abcfbf7ccde1c182c4.jpg"},{"name":"The Dream Is Weird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/35f3fe52debcc14440e72b74e50333be0f3692e2.jpg"},{"name":"You see Frank, Sarah\u2019s father","path":"https://cdn.akama